/-- From the three sieve bounds and the numeric comparison to the count. -/
private theorem Taske724d7d203de1af512de02c5_combine
    (s cA1 cA2 cB3 cC κ L X2 Vz P S T3 G : ℝ)
    (hκ : 0 < κ) (hL : 0 < L) (hX2 : 0 ≤ X2) (hVz0 : 0 ≤ Vz)
